<title>POLAND: Polish rubber firm sets issue price at PLN 25.</title>
<headline>Polish rubber firm sets issue price at PLN 25.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish rubber producer Stomil Sanok SA set the issue price of its 500,000 new shares at 25 zlotys per share, at the upper limit of earlier set 16 to 25 zlotys range, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Investors may subscribe for up to 20,000 shares of the company, which seeks the main market listing, in a public offering scheduled from November 4 to November 15.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
